ntc (2.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Editor camera always follows primary cursor (auto-centering)
  * Welcome screen with keybindings guide
  * theme edit/where/make commands for theme management
  * gosc v/s/vs view options with output zone display
  * ral/igcare/theme make template creation commands
  * image2doc basic image-to-text conversion
  * Down key fix, Home key scroll_x sync, cut/backspace dirty regions
  * Generic InteractiveMenu helper for consistent UI
  * Unified report and ignore/care command functions
  * Split render.rs into modular files

