ntc (2.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-tab editor with tab bar, tab switching, close buttons
  * Crash recovery with periodic SHA-256 snapshots
  * Syntax highlighting for 45+ languages (Inno Setup, lock files)
  * Sidebar file explorer with scroll bar
  * Multi-cursor editing and auto-completion
  * fs/ds/locate wildcard patterns (*, %, _, $)
  * gs grep content search command
  * ran task runner with NTCRANFILE.toml
  * Full theme system (61 colors, export/import)
  * Shell refactored into modular commands

